---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Research Outputs">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Research Outputs</h1>
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Research</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="content">
    <div class="container">
      <p>
        The SCAN II project produces comprehensive research on the enforcement of EU civil procedures
        across Member States. Below you can find our main research outputs.
      </p>

      <div class="research-item">
        <h2>Comparative and Analytical Study</h2>
        <p>
          The "Comparative and Analytical Study of Best Practices" examines enforcement procedures for
          ESCP judgments across all EU Member States, identifying best practices and areas for
          improvement in cross-border enforcement.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/documents/comparative-study.pdf" class="btn" download>Download Comparative Study (PDF)</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="research-item">
        <h2>SCAN2 Platform Walkthrough</h2>
        <p>
          Watch a demonstration of the SCAN2 Platform by the DIKE research team, showcasing how to navigate
          and use the platform for accessing enforcement information across EU Member States.
        </p>
        <div class="video-container">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/2czOLvXHggY"
            title="SCAN 2 - Small Claims Analysis Net - The newest platform"
            frameborder="0"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
            allowfullscreen>
          </iframe>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="research-item">
        <h2>Access the Platform</h2>
        <p>
          For detailed information on enforcement procedures in each Member State, visit our SCAN2 Platform.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="https://portal.scan2.vub.be" class="btn btn-accent" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Access SCAN2 Platform</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .research-item {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .research-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .research-item h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .video-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%; /* 16:9 aspect ratio */
    margin-top: 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #000;
  }

  .video-container iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: none;
  }
</style>
